&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join a high-growth company at an exciting stage of its journey. As one of our first commercial hires in the region, you&#39;ll play a key role in establishing Orennia&#39;s presence across the UK power markets, building relationships with industry leaders, and helping renewable energy developers, investors, utilities, and infrastructure owners make better decisions through data and analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with a multidisciplinary team of market experts, analysts, product leaders, and executives to shape our go-to-market strategy, influence product direction, and drive commercial growth across the region.&amp;nbsp;Our mission is simple: accelerate the energy transition through better data and intelligence. Every conversation you have and every client you support contributes to the development of cleaner, more resilient energy systems around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re entrepreneurial, intellectually curious, and excited by the opportunity to build something meaningful, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
