&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement the go-to-market strategy to engage leaders across renewable energy developers, IPPs, private equity firms, banking, and clean fuels developers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Orennia&#39;s commercial growth across the UK energy market by identifying, developing, and closing new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a robust pipeline of opportunities across renewable energy developers, utilities, independent power producers, infrastructure funds, private equity firms, banks, and energy market participants.&lt;/li&gt;
