&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic account plans and tailored engagement strategies for key prospects and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with prospects to understand their business challenges and demonstrate how Orennia&#39;s analytics and market intelligence can support investment and commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Orennia at industry conferences, client meetings, and market events across UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Research, Marketing, and Client Success teams to deliver an exceptional customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market feedback and client insights that help shape product development and future growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
