&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of success in a quota-carrying sales role selling SaaS, analytics, market intelligence, data, or technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience navigating complex enterprise sales cycles and engaging senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable building new markets, creating opportunities from scratch, and operating with a high degree of autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, with the ability to engage executives, investors, and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
